 Image classification experiments","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s1","report_id":"final_005","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s2","report_id":"final_005","text":"The dataset was split into 70 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s3","report_id":"final_005","text":"We trained each model for 30 epochs with a batch size of 128.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s4","report_id":"final_005","text":"Figure 1 shows the test accuracy of BERT-base by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s5","report_id":"final_005","text":"BERT-base reaches 86.7% test accuracy on IMDB.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s6","report_id":"final_005","text":"BERT-base achieves 66.7% test accuracy on IMDB (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s7","report_id":"final_005","text":"Figure 2 shows the f1 score during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s8","report_id":"final_005","text":"ResNet-50 attains a F1 score of 49.6% at epoch 2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s9","report_id":"final_005","text":"ViT-S reaches 85.8% F1 score at epoch 22 (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s10","report_id":"final_005","text":"At epoch 22, MobileNet achieves 65.0% F1 score.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s11","report_id":"final_005","text":"GRU attains a F1 score of 81.7% at epoch 8.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s12","report_id":"final_005","text":"Figure 3 shows the test accuracy of CNN by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s13","report_id":"final_005","text":"As shown in Figure 3, CNN scores 28.8 points higher on SST-2 than on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s14","report_id":"final_005","text":"CNN scores 1.8 points higher on SST-2 than on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s15","report_id":"final_005","text":"CNN scores 19.8 points higher on SST-2 than on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s16","report_id":"final_005","text":"Figure 4 shows the validation accuracy during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s17","report_id":"final_005","text":"From epoch 10 to epoch 20, the validation accuracy of CNN improves by a relative 10.9%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s18","report_id":"final_005","text":"CNN outperforms EfficientNet by 6 percentage points at epoch 25 (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s19","report_id":"final_005","text":"CNN reaches 38.7% validation accuracy at epoch 5 (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s20","report_id":"final_005","text":"As shown in Figure 4, at epoch 10, EfficientNet achieves 61.0% validation accuracy.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s21","report_id":"final_005","text":"SVM reaches 88.8% accuracy on Yelp.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_005_s22","report_id":"final_005","text":"We note that the training was stable for all models.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}